  <section><div class="container narrow"><h2>What you can expect</h2><p>We ask for enough detail to understand the property and reach you using your preferred contact method. We do not present an inquiry as a guaranteed offer or a substitute for independent professional advice.</p><p class="notice">Business identity, applicable licensing disclosures and public mailbox verification remain under owner review before production launch.</p><a class="button" href="/sell-your-house/">Explore selling options</a></div></section>
